WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — three-body (90s) AI-synthesized studio narration

1
00:00:02.245 --> 00:00:04.180
Two bodies orbit in closed form;

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:09.140
add a third coupled body and small perturbations trigger long-horizon instability.

3
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:19.162
Parnas hid internal secrets, Conway mapped org charts to modules,

4
00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:23.389
yet neither prevented silent semantic mismatches across boundaries.

5
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:34.787
This three-dimensional gyroscopic model shows three coupled rings—specification,

6
00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:39.305
implementation, and operation—locked into phase by explicit gates.

7
00:00:45.226 --> 00:00:48.674
Where assumptions are mechanized, defect classes vanish;

8
00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:52.800
where boundaries remain informal, bugs migrate straight to the gap.

9
00:00:58.722 --> 00:01:03.083
Independent studies confirm that explicitly naming linking, hardware,

10
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:07.318
and unit contracts turns chaotic debugging into monotonic progress.

11
00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:20.923
Verification stabilizes only what is stated inside the boundary—motivating total, interface-checked forms across the stack.
